"\n\n\n\n\n## Review\nLike a movie director, it is fast-paced.  \nIt retrieves the 'bait' (foreshadowing) carefully piled up in volume 1 and develops the story quickly.  \n\nMany people are sacrificed to build the utopia they think of.  \nDoes  really exist?\n\nA Korean-style time-leap work, the story development is fast and the probability of the stories seems high.  \nA book I want to recommend to many. Since this book, personal prejudices against Korean novels seem to have disappeared.  \n"